  "lang": "en",
  "demoScript": "Three years ago I quit my job with no plan. Everyone told me I was crazy. The first six months were the hardest of my life. I sold my car. I moved back in with my parents. But then one small client turned into ten. And today I run a team of twelve. So if you're scared, that's normal. Start anyway."
